        "description": "Leon’s “little sister” who supports him. They are not related by blood but she thinks of him as a real older brother. She does her best to look after Leon, who is useless when it comes to anything except research. She’s cheerful and unafraid of anything or anyone, a really energetic girl. \n\n(Source: Honey's Anime)\n\n\t\t\t\n",
